m-word="">мы </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сделаем </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">это </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вместе </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">на </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">следующих </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">шагах.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Когда </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">закончишь, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">напиши </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">мне: </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">«Репозиторий </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">создан»</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Если </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">на </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">экране </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">появятся </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">другие </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">поля </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">или </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">ты </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">найдёшь </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нужную </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">кнопку, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">можешь </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">прислать </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">скриншот </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">страницы </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">я </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">подскажу, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">куда </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нажать.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Копировать"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.7866