="">редактирование, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">GitHub </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">предложит </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нажать </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Commit </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">changes</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">чтобы </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сохранить </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">обновлённый </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Твоя </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">очередь</span></h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Сейчас </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">только </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">открой </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README.md</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">и </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нажми </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">на </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">карандаш.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Напиши </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">мне, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">что </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">ты </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">видишь:</span></span></p><ul class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">А</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">открылся </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">редактор, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">где </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">можно </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">писать </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">текст.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Б</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">могу </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">найти </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README.md.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">В</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">файл </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">есть, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">но </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вижу </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">карандаш.</span></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Дальше </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">пойдём </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вместе </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нужно </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">ничего </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">менять </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">до </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">моего </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">следующего </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">объяснения.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1