 data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">стиль </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">так, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">как </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">в </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Word. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">В </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README.md</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">используется </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">язык </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">разметки </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Markdown</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">С </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">его </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">помощью </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">можно </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">добавлять </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">заголовки, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">выделять </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">текст, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">оформлять </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Java-код, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вставлять </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">картинки </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">и </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">создавать </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-