ала </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вставь </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">шаблон, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">нажми </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Preview</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">и </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">посмотри </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">результат.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Когда </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">закончишь, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">напиши </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">мне </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">«Готово, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Preview </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">посмотрела»</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">и </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">мы </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">вместе </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сохраним </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">изменения. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Затем </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">создадим </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">обязательную </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">папку </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-componen