-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Здесь </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">java-coffee.png</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">— </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">имя </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">загруженного </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">файла. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Оно </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">должно </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">совпадать </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">точно, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">включая </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">расширение.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Нажми </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Preview</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">: </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">если </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">всё </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сделано </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">правильно, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">изображение </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">появится </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">в </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">После </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">этого </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сохрани </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">изменения </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">через </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Commit </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">changes</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Давай </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">пока </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">остановимся </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">на </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">первом </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">шаге:</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">сохрани </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">картинку </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">на </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">компьютер. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Напиши </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">мне </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">«Сохранила», </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">и </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">я </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">помогу </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">продолжить, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">не </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">переходя </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">к </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">следующим </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">действиям </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">раньше </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">времени.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Скопировать изображение"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7